<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><text class="hero-title">目标制定</text><text class="hero-subtitle">按照适合自己的节奏，慢慢靠近</text></view>
  <view class="account-card row" bindtap="goRegister"><view><text class="account-title">手机号注册</text><text class="account-value">{{profileLabel}}</text></view><text class="account-arrow">›</text></view>
  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">身体目标</text>
    <view class="field"><text class="field-label">身高（cm，用于计算 BMI）</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{settings.height}}" placeholder="例如 165" data-field="height" bindinput="onFieldInput" /></view>
    <view class="two-column">
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">目标体重（kg）</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{settings.targets.weight}}" placeholder="选填" data-field="weight" bindinput="onTargetInput" /></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">目标体脂率（%）</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{settings.targets.bodyFat}}" placeholder="选填" data-field="bodyFat" bindinput="onTargetInput" /></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">目标腰围（cm）</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{settings.targets.waist}}" placeholder="选填" data-field="waist" bindinput="onTargetInput" /></view>
      <view class="field"><text class="field-label">目标臀围（cm）</text><input class="input" type="digit" value="{{settings.targets.hip}}" placeholder="选填" data-field="hip" bindinput="onTargetInput" /></view>
    </view>
    <button class="primary-button" bindtap="save">保存目标</button>
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="goTrends">查看身体变化曲线</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">💉 提醒</text>
    <view class="field"><text class="field-label">计划间隔（天）</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{settings.shotIntervalDays}}" data-field="shotIntervalDays" bindinput="onFieldInput" /><text class="helper">只计算日期，请按医生确定的频率填写。</text></view>
    <view class="field"><text class="field-label">当前药品有效期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{settings.medicationExpiryDate}}" bindchange="onFieldInput" data-field="medicationExpiryDate"><view class="picker">{{settings.medicationExpiryDate || '请选择日期'}}</view></picker></view>
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="save">保存提醒</button>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="row"><view><text class="data-title">本机数据</text><text class="data-subtitle">{{stats.daily}} 天记录 · {{stats.shots}} 次 💉</text></view><text class="local-tag">仅本机</text></view>
    <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="copyBackup">复制 JSON 数据</button><button class="danger-button" bindtap="clearAll">清空全部数据</button>
  </view>
  <view class="privacy-card"><text class="privacy-title">温馨说明</text><text>目标请结合医生或专业人士的建议制定。本工具只用于记录，不提供诊断或方案调整。</text></view>
</view>
